hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"102","“He (Allah bless him and give him peace) used to wear a signet ring on his right hand.”"
"103","\"Allah’s Messenger (Allah bless him and give him peace) chose a signet ring of gold, and he used to wear it on his right hand. The people therefore chose signet rings of gold, so he threw it away (Allah bless him and give him peace) and said: 'I shall never wear it!' The people therefore threw their signet rings away.”"
"104","“Ihe pommel of the sword of Allah’s Messenger (Allah bless him and give him peace) was made of silver.”"
"105","“The pommel of the sword of Allah’s Messenger (Allah bless him and give him peace) was made of silver.\""
